{"props":{"artworkCredits":{"Base":{"illustrator":"Studio Montagne","originalDesigner":null}},"factionEmblem":"/faction-icons/Rhodes Island.webp","skillTimings":[],"operator":{"name":"Rhodes Island Recon","rarity":1,"class":"Vanguard","branch":"Tactician","faction":"Rhodes Island","umbrellaFactions":[],"connectedFactions":[],"region":null,"subRegion":null,"position":"Ranged","tags":["DP-Recovery","Crowd-Control"],"trait":"This unit can designate one Tactical Point within attack range to call Reinforcements ; ATK is increased to 150% when attacking enemies blocked by Reinforcements; ignores the Deployment Limit , but has a long Redeployment Time","howToObtain":{"Limited":"No","Standard Headhunting":"No","Kernel Headhunting":"No","Recruitment":"No","Welfare":{"Unlock Type":"Limited Welfare","Unlock Location":"Thunder in the Azure Dream"},"Shop Operator":"No"},"alternate":null,"skins":["Camping Time Nya"],"ep":{"Main":null,"Co-star":null},"internalName":"char_4215_buddy","otherLanguages":{"Chinese":"罗德岛隐秘队"},"characterInfo":{"File no.":"MH04","Illustrator":"Studio Montagne","Release Date":"2026/11/04","Kernel Addition Date":"N/A"},"characterVoices":null,"basicInfo":{"Gender":"未知","Combat Experience":"未知","Place of Birth":"未知","Date of Birth":"未知","Race":"未公开","Height":"未知","Infection Status":"Medical tests have confirmed that no infection is present."},"physicalExam":{"Physical Strength":"Standard","Mobility":"Excellent","Endurance":"Normal/Average","Tactical Acumen":"Normal/Average","Combat Skill":"Normal/Average"},"talents":[{"name":"Felyne Wyvernblast 1","rows":[{"stage":"Base","potential":null,"description":"The first attack on the first 3 enemies to be attacked instead attaches a Felyne Wyvernblast. Damage from other friendly units detonates the Felyne Wyvernblast, dealing 150% of Rhodes Island Recon's ATK as damage, Stunning them for 2 seconds, and restoring 1 DP . Felyne Wyvernblast disappears after being detonated or after 30 seconds."}]},{"name":"Felyne WyvernblastReplacesFelyne Wyvernblast 1","rows":[{"stage":"Base","potential":"Potential 2","description":"The first attack on the first 3 enemies to be attacked instead attaches a Felyne Wyvernblast. Damage from other friendly units detonates the Felyne Wyvernblast, dealing 230% of Rhodes Island Recon's ATK as damage, Stunning them for 2.2 seconds, and restoring 1 DP. Felyne Wyvernblast disappears after being detonated or after 30 seconds."}]},{"name":"Felyne Wyvernblast 3ReplacesFelyne Wyvernblast 2","rows":[{"stage":"Base","potential":"Potential 3","description":"The first attack on the first 3 enemies to be attacked instead attaches a Felyne Wyvernblast. Damage from other friendly units detonates the Felyne Wyvernblast, dealing 280% of Rhodes Island Recon's ATK as damage, Stunning them for 2.4 seconds, and restoring 1 DP. Felyne Wyvernblast disappears after being detonated or after 30 seconds."}]},{"name":"Felyne Wyvernblast 4ReplacesFelyne Wyvernblast 3","rows":[{"stage":"Base","potential":"Potential 4","description":"The first attack on the first 3 enemies to be attacked instead attaches a Felyne Wyvernblast. Damage from other friendly units detonates the Felyne Wyvernblast, dealing 350% of Rhodes Island Recon's ATK as damage, Stunning them for 2.6 seconds, and restoring 1 DP. Felyne Wyvernblast disappears after being detonated or after 30 seconds."}]},{"name":"Felyne Wyvernblast 5ReplacesFelyne Wyvernblast 4","rows":[{"stage":"Base","potential":"Potential 5","description":"The first attack on the first 3 enemies to be attacked instead attaches a Felyne Wyvernblast. Damage from other friendly units detonates the Felyne Wyvernblast, dealing 420% of Rhodes Island Recon's ATK as damage, Stunning them for 2.8 seconds, and restoring 1 DP. Felyne Wyvernblast disappears after being detonated or after 30 seconds."}]},{"name":"Felyne Wyvernblast 6ReplacesFelyne Wyvernblast 5","rows":[{"stage":"Base","potential":"Potential 6","description":"The first attack on the first 3 enemies to be attacked instead attaches a Felyne Wyvernblast. Damage from other friendly units detonates the Felyne Wyvernblast, dealing 500% of Rhodes Island Recon's ATK as damage, Stunning them for 3 seconds, and restoring 1 DP. Felyne Wyvernblast disappears after being detonated or after 30 seconds."}]}],"potential":{"levels":[{"level":2,"benefit":"Felyne Wyvernblast 1 becomes Felyne Wyvernblast 2"},{"level":3,"benefit":"Felyne Wyvernblast 2 becomes Felyne Wyvernblast 3"},{"level":4,"benefit":"Felyne Wyvernblast 3 becomes Felyne Wyvernblast 4"},{"level":5,"benefit":"Felyne Wyvernblast 4 becomes Felyne Wyvernblast 5"},{"level":6,"benefit":"Felyne Wyvernblast 5 becomes Felyne Wyvernblast 6"}],"totalCost":[{"name":"Rhodes Island Recon's Token","quantity":5}]},"promotion":[],"skills":{"skillList":[],"skillCost":null},"baseSkills":[],"modules":[],"review":{"official":"由艾露猫政宗和牙猎犬义经组成的罗德岛隐秘队，命名来自他们在家乡炎火村隶属的编制——“随从隐秘队”。政宗和义经在情报调查和素材收集方面本就接受过专业训练，且在泡影国磨练了很长时间，因此，刚加入罗德岛就立刻在各项任务中发挥了重要作用。他们想要找到回家的道路，但本身也相当热衷于在泰拉大陆上进行冒险，因而，在这里的生活，他们适应得还算不错。\n活泼友善的政宗迅速成为干员中的明星——许多干员都申请和政宗一起出任务，为的就是看一看会说话的可爱“云兽”，而原本孤高的义经也和许多热衷于战斗的干员打成一片。","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":30,"base":{"hp":442,"atk":74,"def":36,"res":0,"redeploy":200,"dp":3,"block":1,"interval":1},"max":{"hp":590,"atk":107,"def":45,"res":0,"redeploy":200,"dp":3,"block":1,"interval":1},"rangeId":"3-1"}],"trust":{"hp":100,"atk":15,"def":0}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked by default","description":"造影检测结果显示，两位干员体内脏器轮廓清晰，未见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测未见异常，无矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为非矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】0%\n政宗和义经均没有被源石感染的迹象。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】未公开\n根据医疗部决议，不公开相关数据。"},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"在和A6小队的成员们聊到“猎人”这个概念时，政宗一改往常的活泼，变得有些严肃，在一旁假寐的义经也竖起了耳朵。\n在他们的故乡，猎人要做的事情，是在狩猎怪物的同时保护生态，因此，每一位猎人，都是探索未知的先驱者，比如“炎火村的烈焰”，正是解决炎火村危机——“百龙夜行”的大英雄。\n“优秀的猎人都有一项特质，那就是——永不言弃的挑战精神喵！”\n无论面对怎样棘手的敌人，无论失败多少次，真正的猎人总是会不断地发起挑战，直到胜利，或者倒下。在政宗的口中，“猎人”不仅是一种职业，更是一种精神的象征。\n“看起来是离我们这支小队最远的东西。”斑点忍不住说道。\n“我也觉得欸，我没那么了不起的，我只是觉得好玩而已。”空爆也附和道。挑战精神？她可不觉得自己拿起盾斧的理由有那么高尚。\n但政宗却摇了摇头。\n“如果是以前的话，我可能也会这么想喵。但是现在不一样了，泡影国的人也好，罗德岛的人也好，只是战斗的对象和理由跟猎人不一样喵！大家都是富有挑战精神的人喵！”"}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/one-star-icons/Rhodes%20Island%20Recon%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/one-star-skins/Rhodes%20Island%20Recon%20-%20Base.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Rhodes Island","type":"faction","entries":[{"operatorName":"Closure","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Closure%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"Minimum DP -4 ( -1 ) when Closure is in the squad; all [Rhodes Island] Operators ATK +4%.","matchedKeyword":"Rhodes Island"}]},{"operatorName":"Kal'tsit - Esperanta","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Kal'tsit%20-%20Esperanta%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"When other allies enter this unit's Attack Range, they will immediately gain 1 Shield and be granted a buff, healing by 60 ( +10 ) HP per second for 30 seconds (This effect is unable to be stacked and the healing effect is doubled for [Rhodes Island] Operators).","matchedKeyword":"Rhodes Island"}]},{"operatorName":"Angelina the Mellow Wish","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Angelina%20the%20Mellow%20Wish%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Ascalon","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Ascalon%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Blaze","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Blaze%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Blaze the Igniting Spark","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Blaze%20the%20Igniting%20Spark%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Ceobe","operato